00:02:52,208 --> 00:02:56,913
If you're driving through a beautiful country and it's during the spring, you can smell all the flowers.

41
00:02:56,913 --> 00:03:02,955
These cars are a much better sense of getting in tune with the nature around you and your drive that you're on.

42
00:03:02,955 --> 00:03:07,722
It brings you much more pleasure than any other vehicle would, I think, out there.

43
00:03:07,722 --> 00:03:11,670
The great thing about traveling in a Land Rover is it's very much not the destination.

44
00:03:11,670 --> 00:03:14,666
