47
00:03:20,131 --> 00:03:30,560
If you haven't done the work to get the car in a condition that it will start in the morning, then that's on you.

48
00:03:30,560 --> 00:03:33,353
That'd be why she wasn't running and starting so well.

49
00:03:33,353 --> 00:03:34,954
Oh, this is a great day.

50
00:03:34,954 --> 00:03:37,405
Maybe she'll start first time now.

51
00:03:37,405 --> 00:03:41,973
There's a lot more satisfaction because you've got there together and it's very much a team effort.

52
00:03:41,973 --> 00:03:43,612
I tell people it's grown man LEGOs.

53
00:03:43,612 --> 00:03:47,999
It's a car you can totally disassemble and you can completely assemble it again.

54
