You have to kind of understand maybe what to fix with it, but I think people enjoy that.

59
00:04:11,192 --> 00:04:15,215
It's going back to the, you know, analog camera versus a digital camera.

60
00:04:15,215 --> 00:04:19,404
So, people give Land Rovers a hard time because they're always breaking down.

61
00:04:19,404 --> 00:04:24,897
Yeah, but, like, get yourself a 40, 50, 60-year-old car that you can use as a daily.

