69
00:04:57,201 --> 00:05:03,171
It was made to be produced very, very quickly and efficiently, not just in components, but in price.

70
00:05:03,171 --> 00:05:08,710
It's expected to cost about 450 pounds and has passed a number of very severe tests.

71
00:05:08,710 --> 00:05:13,837
And in 1948, the first vehicles were taken to the Amsterdam Motor Show.&nbsp;

72
00:05:13,837 --> 00:05:23,904
By July, when they started production, there was already this euphoria of this multipurpose vehicle that you could go anywhere in and do anything with.

73
