76
00:05:38,770 --> 00:05:44,012
Series II, Series III, well, Series 4 being the Defender, so it all kinda had that.&nbsp;

77
00:05:44,012 --> 00:05:50,129
Nobody set about sort of thinking, "Oh, why don't we keep this vehicle in production and create an icon?"

78
00:05:50,129 --> 00:05:52,279
But effectively, that's what they did.

79
00:05:52,279 --> 00:06:02,192
